        "line_end": 5,
        "exact_text": "Step 1 — Mathematical analysis: Compute the total state space size for the 8-puzzle, determine how many configurations are solvable, verify whether this specific initial state can reach the goal state, and compute the Manhattan distance heuristic for the initial state. Save to puzzle_analysis.json with: total_configurations, solvable_configurations, initial_state, goal_state, inversion_count, is_solvable, manhattan_distance, and tile_distances array showing each of the 8 numbered tiles' (1-8) Manhattan distance.\n",
        "source_sha256": "8f9f2945fdd63d1854a58540feddf87052e85cb78c70bfe12415e92ada5f0a50",
